  "description": "Validate robots.txt from the command line and test whether URLs are allowed for Googlebot, Bingbot or any user agent, with RFC 9309 matching (wildcards, $, longest match). Flags SEO mistakes like blocked CSS/JS or Disallow: /. Zero-dependency Node.js CLI, library and GitHub Action. Free online version by PromoPilot.",
